                                "sense_id": "204dcd32-ae18-3f84-8624-6b3dee33cb5e",
                                "text": "He bringeth counsellors also to a foolish end, when they do anything good even, with no good purpose, but are going after the recompensing of a temporal reward."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b7c40bc8-d529-4805-b784-ab8823068f8e",
                                "sense_id": "204dcd32-ae18-3f84-8624-6b3dee33cb5e",
                                "text": "But that it was by no means absent is shown by the numerous instances in Acts of the punishment of evildoers and the recompensing of the righteous."
                            }
                        ]
